      <activity id="21900be5-a6f3-5116-928a-eb21d001493f" activityNameId="80a0c1a8-29d4-5494-9276-2c3ffb47a18c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fuel elements PWR, UO2 3.8% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fuel elements PWR, UO2 3.8% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant
The shares are based on the current core management of French PWRs, at equilibrium, where 20 units of the 900 MW class use 30% MOX. Not all plutonium extracted at reprocessing from French spent fuel elements seems to be used at present, but in the near future this will be achieved with other units operating with MOX. Hence, the indication of data validity inputted in "TimePeriod" only says that the shares represent the knowledge available today of the fuel management for the French nuclear park.;
UUID: 243d243a-10be-319b-97a7-65f725b59892
The module consists of the share of UO2 and MOX fuel elements.
Location: French conditions
Technology: Data reflects the use of UO2 and MOX fuel elements in current nuclear reactors.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_243d243a-10be-319b-97a7-65f725b59892.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
